 False; line 11:\n  append → `out = [[0,1],[1,2]]`.\n- Return `[[0,1],[1,2]]` (already sorted). Pair `i = [0,1]` (before)\n  `j = [1,2]`: `i.end = 1 >= j.start = 1`. **Violation.**\n\nThe input has 2 ≤ 6 intervals, integer endpoints in `[-10,10]`, and\n`start <= end` for both intervals, so it lies inside the stated domain.\nProvisional verdict for E-C: **VIOLATED**, witness `[[0,1],[1,2]]`.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false}}
